uit agreement docs?\", \"agreement?\", \"others besides third?\", \"total count?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-030\", \"v\": [[\"Which expenses were over $100?\", \"Could you tell me which of my expenses came to more than 100 pounds?\", \"expenses over €100?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-031\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's in my vault about Willowmere, please?\", \"hmm so I was just wondering, do I have anything at all saved about Willowmere?\", \"What have I got in the vault about Willowmere?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-032\", \"v\": [[\"What's my login for Dentist? Not the password, just the username.\", \"Also, can you put Piano lesson in my calendar friday at 9am?\", \"Different thing: can you restore the Mattress document I deleted?\", \"And what documents are in the Car folder?\"], [\"um, what was the login I used for Dentist? just the username bit, I don't need the password\", \"oh and while I think of it, could you pop Piano lesson into my diary for friday at 09:00?\", \"and, er, also I binned the Mattress document, could you bring it back?\", \"right, one more, what documents have I got in the Car folder?\"], [\"Dentist login? not password\", \"Piano lesson friday 9am\", \"restore Mattress doc\", \"Car folder docs\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-033\", \"v\": [[\"add 12 quid for firewood to the weekend group, i paid\", \"Can you add $12 for firewood to the weekend group? I paid for it.\", \"Would you please add an expense of 12 pounds for firewood to the weekend group, paid by me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-034\", \"v\": [[\"stuff under Car?\", \"so, um, what have I actually got filed away under Car?\", \"What do I have filed under Car?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-035\", \"v\": [[\"where r the Energy app details\", \"what about Streaming wifi\", \"also when do i need to remember Yannick Pellegrini's bday\", \"diff thing, find anything w tickets\", \"any expenses about it too?\"], [\"Where can I find the details for the Energy app?\", \"What about Streaming wifi?\", \"Also, when is Yannick Pellegrin